  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been trying to find worlds that were submitted to world jams in the past like the Obstacle Course one that I wasn't around for but really want to visit. Jams are great for curated content but once a they're over it's not as easy to find worlds submitted to them even if they have some related tags. \n\nI'd love to see a world category in the world search menu sidebar for filtering results from specific jams or directing the play to a specific world list of submissions. I'd even be happy if it was a website-only thing as looking for past VRChat jams through Itch.io is also very difficult.",
